{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47954","headline":"诗二首 一 · 虎丘山石壁鬼","name":"诗二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高松多悲风，萧萧清且哀。\n南山接幽壠，幽壠空崔嵬。\n白日徒昭昭，不照长夜台。\n虽知生者乐，魂魄安能回。\n况复念所亲，恸哭心肝摧。\n恸哭更何言，哀哉复哀哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虎丘山石壁鬼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47954.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47954","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}